      "summary": "**The first successful self-propagating attack in the npm ecosystem**. The postinstall script harvests secrets and exfiltrates them to public GitHub repositories the attackers created (named Shai-Hulud). CISA issued an alert on 09-23; **500+ packages** were affected. The theft targets explicitly include GitHub PATs, AWS/GCP/Azure keys, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, Claude Code configs and `.mcp.json`. Wiz assesses it as sharing the same origin as s1ngularity",
